      "content": "<columns>\nThese [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suBCcHso](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suBCcHso) were held from February to April 2024. \n\nThen there was a bifurcation into [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suRqsJU7](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suRqsJU7) with KU and [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su_gvDCu](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su_gvDCu) with AK. \n\n\n\nLanguage of Wisdom ~ Meetings\n\n\n\n|||\n\nKnowledge Engineering  ~ Meetings 3\n\n\n</columns>\n\n",
